WEBVTT

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:00.393
but it is something else.

00:03:00.417 --> 00:03:02.934
It is a myth.

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:06.917
There is no such thing as race.

00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:14.643
Scientific research shows
that race is an illusion.

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:16.018
For example,

00:03:16.042 --> 00:03:19.101
someone of European descent

00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:23.601
might be genetically closer
to an Asian person

00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:26.375
than to someone else of European descent.

00:03:27.542 --> 00:03:31.393
So if race isn't a biological fact,